=\"437\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ab32510-1256-41ac-ab09-316d0d961af1\" />\r\n\r\nThis issue is also present in the editor, so it's not exclusive to the project manager anyway.\r\n\r\nPS: This editor setting is not meant to use syntax highlighting, as it displays file paths, not code. I fixed this in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116743.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116014#pullrequestreview-3851181803","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116014","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-02-25T00:20:08Z"}]